ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=71MxS5s8RvUQ7kNvwFbSiT1&_nc_oc=AdqpYbaiNFIGSWhrJwMRHIudZyX9-uqtNFS_QdsUzhMKedAKrfNw5JmBNdbAnYY33NU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Mi704YcdMrWhWJO955L_7QPbj1Er-g6KLoeoDJLWbMg&oe=6A1C51FC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x2cwCvfj1qQQ7kNvwE4tg3X&_nc_oc=Ado7P_GfxBGTO-XTks8iXrFV4iK3Pnny1OPf596J1CFDaXcfdDo-GDBjA0xBQbXLHGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4BHULutYzdw3k68_LsbWGKwXstNj9tZ9FIrMsOsBMUtQ&oe=6A1C3616"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iJfNDLnEzs4Q7kNvwF7l8Ex&_nc_oc=AdqXnE83q-AL9HSGEY8tRDK5H7NDHgXPL41yJlfriOs6D9WpCAp0tY5Di5v3M3ZMHlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af58RD1n3Vldwz0VH_WxTGmjyVmID8_Gj6UZZ36QXIUNBQ&oe=6A1C43E4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_